 "s01.png", "id": "1290313560836135", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1290313564169468_1944919212542852064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=67eme3FMOcUQ7kNvwHsgn5L&_nc_oc=AdoBwsZKRiayzwto2aW9GkMaYnVnU1ssyxyZ85rudaJrv5udr_Xew_yGRjUbzKna_JI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQgR1DqGzHbOLz1DsZU27hUcx1JvUFN-UGrVd-RtZGKug&oe=6B01C05C"}, {"file_name": "s02.png", "id": "1733073644664645", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1733073661331310_5629461049321258325_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p9LBTRPYyT0Q7kNvwET25FP&_nc_oc=AdoAJRfqpHd5KEdGOi6mcCkUgqx0W--9yMeES5fGBVcfVqVEmOdWmkuT9zkFK-TF73g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbt0T_NpkT6I45nwlzpiSXMEKsvpEyALoXL8MwfLAPrQ&oe=6B01E6EB"}, {"file_name": "s03.png", "id": "1875467957141997", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1875467960475330_1872312137828573140_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jC2QUjwjpIUQ7kNvwGIZ0oO&_nc_oc=AdpWG1_5ckGLNQsoi0d6vUEFRHBTx2aJoX5ebhLz3C_hq0efzqPHf8D3jSN2iO4lEVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSYrxYTZuHujxiNL1ZMB1Ln8f6mgdwXHJ6pS0QvszGwmQ&oe=6B01DCE2"}, {"file_name": "s05.png", "id": "2480112452457438", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2480112455790771_8140092662538143972_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0yEYDD7UMzIQ7kNvwHwKMFr&_nc_oc=AdrXU-h_C4Vfv4sBsB7lDjfq8keIykIWdDmgoXxxVwACCVInCBB0M7KsVnpj2ejGdrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqjsVdQcOAmPw5EGw3_RgsjKA_6C9PA2-UvJzjdMXnNQ&oe=6B01EC97"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art-2.png", "id": "1343471021008476", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1343471024341809_1635249537243616296_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h_NtL4WMXHoQ7kNvwHcy9fg&_nc_oc=AdpdzxyEAFZ1Yp_hzLU_kMHYY0tylYwWtHJyX_LQAjIknM0Azp60hsz-Yy8Yz1HXhUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7h3tMbOmLyzY2W6KQGyCTI6EKULCDya0fporx1ESR6g&oe=6B01E622"}, "display_name": "Omega Pilot Evolution", "keywords": ["racing", "futuristic", "speed", "antigravity", "Scifi"], "long_description": "Omega Pilot Evolution is a high-speed first-person VR racing experience. Take control of futuristic anti-gravity ships and master precision piloting across dynamic tracks built for extreme speed.\n\n**Career Mode**\n\nRace against recorded runs of real players, improve your skills, and progress through increasingly challenging tracks.\n{1074932615539098}\n\n**Series Mode**\n\nCompete against AI opponents in a series of races and fight for the top position.\n\n**Single Race Mode**\n\nChoose a track and race against AI opponents at your own pace.\n\n**Cross-Platform Multiplayer**\n\nRace against real players in real time and play with friends across different platforms. VR and non-VR players can race together in the same multiplayer sessions!\n\n**Combat Racing Mode**\n\nCollect weapons, use shields, and outmaneuver your opponents in high-speed races.\n\n{1099198279368277}\n\n**Combat Arena Mode**\n\nFly freely around the arena, collect weapons, and battle real players or AI opponents.\n\n**Customization & Upgrades**\n\nEarn in-game currency to upgrade your ship's speed, acceleration, handling, and braking. Unlock visual customizations to create your own style.\n\n{29482518374711634}\n\n**Asynchronous Rivals & Global Leaderboards**\n\nChallenge the recorded runs of other players, set your best times, and climb the global leaderboards.\n", "short_description": "High-speed first-person VR racing experience"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xocus.co/privacy-policy-eng", 